                  {
                    "value": "How horizon_bucket is defined"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "At the series x day level it is the forecast day step (1-14 days after the origin). At the store x category x week level it is the forecast week (1-2). The two levels have different scales and are never shown on one axis."
