                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How accuracy is computed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Errors are stored as additive sums per model, basis, level, origin and horizon. MAE, RMSE, WAPE and bias are always recomputed from the sums (sum of errors / sum of observations). They are never averaged or added across rows."
